    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-005_FRN-OH_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. DUNGS® Combustion Controls\n\nRep→news\n\n      2025-04-04         #005   Content  \n\nMarket launch: new FRN OH\n\nPhase out FRN and FRNG OH\n\nTechnical questions?\n\nPlease ask our Supportcenter: supportcenter@dungs.com or +49 7181-804-804\n\nRepNews created by\n\nAlbert López\n\nProduct Manager\n\na.lopez@dungs.com or +34 606 017 385\n\nStay in touch!   Sign up for our newsletter.   Receive the DUNGS newsletter 6-8 times   a year with information on all aspects of   gas safety- and control technology.  ",
