  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "a7370a2a2134395ff05a31f151184a3d",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-005_FRN-OH_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. Sign up (English version)     \n\nRep→news  \n\n  \n\n2025-04-04 | #005  \n\nMarket launch: new FRN OH\n\nWe’re pleased to announce the market launch of the FRN OH. It’s the new zero pressure regulator which main application focus are on gas engines. This new product substitutes the current FRN and the flanged FRNG OH.",
    "metadata": {
      "data_source": {
