  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "787344fb26ebb2070a9ce9bb5ae02a17",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-005_FRN-OH_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. The FRN OH will be available from 2025-04-07. Covers the range of DN 40 up to DN 150, enlarging FRN with 2 additional sizes. Compared to the zero-pressure function of FRNG and FRNG OH it offers a more sensitive behavior and a lower hysteresis value, being a better option for gas trains in engines using atmospheric mixers. The low hysteresis offers a wide and accurate modulating range within the working range.\n\nl | y P — .. [ S L",
