    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-005_FRN-OH_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. 1R0\n\n2/3\n\nRep→news  \n\n  \n\n2025-04-04 | #005  \n\nPhase out FRN and FRNG OH\n\nAs part of our portfolio optimization strategy, the FRN OH will replace both the FRN and flanged FRNG OH, which will be discontinued on 2025-12-31. The following table shows the items being phased out and their corresponding replacements. To ensure adequate supply before discontinuation, the last order date will be on 2025-09-30.",
